%% Attribution Window — Stream-Stream Join
sequenceDiagram
    participant Send as Send Service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant Flink as Flink
    participant App as User Device
    participant Lake as Lakehouse

    Send->>K: notification.sent (user_id=X, sent_ts=T)
    Note over Flink: Window T → T+30min for user X

    App->>K: app_open (user_id=X, open_ts=T+15min)
    K->>Flink: stream-stream join

    Flink->>Flink: match? open_ts ∈ [T, T+30min]
    Flink->>Lake: attribution = notification_id
    Note over Lake: notification.opened attributed to push

    App->>K: app_open (user_id=X, open_ts=T+45min)
    Note over Flink: Outside window — NOT attributed
